<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>How's My Laptop's Battery Health?</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
      <h1 class="title">How's My Laptop's Battery Health?</h1>
      <div id="Results">
          <p>
              Your laptop's current battery health is at
              {% if battHealth >= 95 %}
                <h1 class="great" id="resultText">
              {% elif battHealth >= 80 and battHealth < 95 %}
                <h1 class="good" id="resultText">
              {% elif battHealth >= 70 and battHealth < 80 %}
                <h1 class="fair" id="resultText">
              {% elif battHealth < 70 %}
                <h1 class="bad" id="resultText">
              {% endif %}
              <span id="percentage">{{ battHealth }}</span>%</h1>
              <h2 id="comment">{{ comment }}</h2>
              From the original <span id="maxCapInput">{{ maxCap }}</span>mAh, you can only charge up to <span id="resultingCap">{{ currCap }}</span>mAh.
          </p>
      </div>
  </body>
</html>